# Build artifacts: regenerated by the pipeline, never edited by hand.
#
# Listed by name rather than as `*.jsonl`, because `eval.jsonl` is hand-written and must
# stay tracked — a blanket rule beside it reads as though it were generated too.
#
# `train.jsonl` and `validation.jsonl` predate this rule and are still in the index, so
# git tracks them regardless of what is written here. Untracking them is a separate
# decision from moving them.
train.jsonl
validation.jsonl
property_type_phrasings.json
